Phonon CPU + Video

This independent adapter uses the Phonon CPU container from Fermion Research:
https://github.com/fermionresearch/phonon
https://github.com/fermionresearch/phonon/pkgs/container/phonon-cpu

No upstream source is copied into the adapter. The image inherits upstream
software and adds distro FFmpeg and Python wrapper dependencies.

Inspected fermion-research 0.2.11 wheel metadata declares Apache-2.0 and carries
LICENSE and NOTICE files. Preserve the originals in the upstream installation.
Its NOTICE credits Fermion Research, Qwen/Alibaba/Hugging Face, and the
Parakeet architecture by NVIDIA. Inspect the actual pinned container packages
before distributing a release; current source is not proof of image contents.

Model weights are not included in this project's source or image. Model
repositories have their own licenses and attribution requirements. The inspected
upstream NOTICE identifies Phonon-2 / NVIDIA Parakeet-derived weights as
CC-BY-4.0 and Phonon-1 / Qwen-derived weights as Apache-2.0. Do not infer that
these entries cover every model or the current Phonon-2.5 release. Check the
exact model revision and preserve its license and NOTICE before deployment
or redistribution.

FFmpeg distribution terms depend on the build and linked codecs. Retain the
installed Debian package copyright and license files under /usr/share/doc.
Review ffmpeg -buildconf, package source availability, GPL/LGPL terms, and
applicable codec obligations before distributing the combined image.
https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

Python wrapper dependencies have separate licenses. Record their resolved
versions in requirements.lock and uv.lock; retain package license metadata in
the wrapper virtual environment. Generate/review an image SBOM before release.

The owner has not selected a license for the new adapter code. This notice
is attribution and a release checklist, not a license grant. A LICENSE file,
third-party distribution review, and model/fixture provenance review are
release blockers. Do not publish the combined image until they are resolved.
